      "date": "2026-03-10T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Whirlpool of India Limited (BSE:500238) completed the acquisition of 3.18% stake in Elica PB Whirlpool Kitchen Appliances Private Limited.",
      "body": "Whirlpool of India Limited (BSE:500238) agreed to acquire 3.18% stake in Elica PB Whirlpool Kitchen Appliances Private Limited for INR 590 million on February 6, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 590 million will be paid by Whirlpool India Limited. As part of consideration, INR 590 million is paid towards common equity of Elica PB Whirlpool Kitchen Appliances Private Limited. Upon completion, Whirlpool India Limited will own 99.99% stake in Elica PB Whirlpool Kitchen Appliances Private Limited.\r\n\r\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Elica PB Whirlpool Kitchen Appliances Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 4.99 billion.\r\n\r\nThe transaction received approval from acquirer board. The expected completion of the transaction is March 31, 2026.\r\n\n\nWhirlpool of India Limited (BSE:500238",
