      "date": "2026-02-07T21:10:40.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.09 (down from ₹3.46 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹18.2b (up 6.5% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹264.9m (down 40% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 1.5% (down from 2.6% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 2.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 20%. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Consumer Durables industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 20% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 13% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
